2KFPMXjyA&oe=6A8EEEE2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "occulus_coverart_placeholder.png", "id": "547061729749417", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75375087_547061736416083_6937420105488662687_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uQr0q7dMegsQ7kNvwEwpDc6&_nc_oc=AdrSJoHKPx4gCNXOGWmG7phE6PNwlwA_7DbkuPz7fRIIgUert_FZj4lZ4c9iFAmObdk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHyNIvh-sL_l4MKYfoSu_YwcwaXKOxHrroZk8mJfOuD4w&oe=6A8ECAA6"}, "display_name": "Curatours", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Visitors can access tours of museums around the world from their desktops, phones or VR headsets. In VR it's an incredibly immersive experience and on other devices it's a bit like a cross between a Zoom Call and playing a game. \n\nYou can choose from three types of tour:\n \nSelf-guided tours can happen at anytime, just login and go exploring!\n \nPre-recorded tours are similar to a self-guided tour only at points a guide will appear to tell you something about that place or the artefact you\u2019re near. It\u2019s a bit like a 3D audio guide.\n \nLive-guided tours put you in a museum or gallery with an expert so you can talk to them and ask questions. To get a live-guided tour you will need to book on to one of the timeslots available. ", "short_description": "Visit art exhibitions and museums with friends and family. Everyone can explore and experience the tours using a either a PC, tablet, smartphone or virtual reality headset."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.coopinnovations.co.uk/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Cooperative Innovations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://cura.tours/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "e